# MetaMask

> MetaMask is a self-custodial cryptocurrency wallet and gateway to blockchain apps. Available as a browser extension and mobile app, MetaMask supports Ethereum, Solana, Bitcoin, Tron, and 10+ other networks. Over 100 million users worldwide.

## Core Product

- [MetaMask — Crypto Wallet & Gateway](https://metamask.io): MetaMask crypto wallet for buying, swapping, sending, and managing tokens and NFTs across Ethereum and major Layer 2 networks, available as a browser extension and mobile app.
- [Card](https://metamask.io/card): Self-custodial crypto card (virtual and metal) for spending stablecoins and crypto directly from a MetaMask wallet via Mastercard, without giving up custody or using banking intermediaries, available across 40+ countries.
- [Perps](https://metamask.io/perps): Marketing page for trading perpetual futures (perps) directly from MetaMask's self-custody wallet, covering long/short leverage on 150+ crypto tokens, US equities, commodities, and currencies via Hyperliquid, with no KYC required.
- [Prediction Markets](https://metamask.io/prediction-markets): Place and track decentralized prediction market bets on politics, sports, crypto, and culture from self-custody in MetaMask, powered by Polymarket liquidity.
- [Rwa](https://metamask.io/rwa): MetaMask landing page for accessing and trading 200+ tokenized real-world assets (RWAs)—including US stocks, ETFs, gold, and private credit—via Ondo Global Markets integration within MetaMask Swaps, for non-US users in supported regions.
- [Rewards](https://metamask.io/rewards): Seasonal points-based loyalty program for the MetaMask self-custodial crypto wallet, earning points through swaps, perps trading, referrals, and the MetaMask Card while retaining non-custodial ownership.
- [Earn](https://metamask.io/earn): Token staking, liquid staking, pool staking, and earning yield on stablecoins directly within the MetaMask crypto wallet.
- [Snaps](https://metamask.io/snaps): Directory of community-built MetaMask Snaps that extend wallet functionality with custom alerts, phishing protection, transaction insights, notifications, and human-readable wallet addresses.
- [Assets](https://metamask.io/assets): Official MetaMask logo and brand assets download page, including logos, visual guidelines, and approved graphics for press and third-party use.

